|---|---|
| Introduction | 30 sec |
| Contexte historique | 2 min |
| Pascal | 1 min |
| Analyse | 3 min |
| Pertinence contemporaine | 1 min |
| Conclusion | 30 sec |

## Total
≈ 8 minutes

